      "Text": "Security update for python311",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for python311 fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-15310: memory exhaustion in zipfile in bzip2/LZMA/Zstandard decompression (bsc#1277111).\n- CVE-2026-19672: tarfile extraction filter bypass allows creation of directories outside the destination (bsc#1276227).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
